Package: ultrastar-song-generator
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: Aaron Sanz Roca <a.sanzblog6b@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @@INSTALLED_SIZE@@
Depends: @@DEPENDS@@
Recommends: ffmpeg, yt-dlp, espeak-ng, nodejs
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/AaronSR-54/ultrastar-song-generator
Description: Generate UltraStar Deluxe songs from audio and video
 Builds UltraStar Deluxe songs from a video or audio file: separates the
 stems, transcribes the lyrics, aligns words and syllables, and estimates
 pitch.
 .
 The desktop app detects yt-dlp, ffmpeg, espeak-ng and Node/Deno at startup
 and warns about any that are missing. None of them is bundled, because the
 app still works without them.
